&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9/10:&amp;nbsp;Light and Shadow&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How does the play of light and shadow animate the experience of a space? Working with tone and value we will explore ways to capture the effect of natural light, as it moves across the interior setting and the forms within.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All materials provided and no previous experience required. All are welcome! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
